<title>POLAND: FARM FOOD JULY NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>FARM FOOD JULY NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.33 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.40 vs   1.32</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.92 vs   1.64</p>
<p> Sales		   24.87 vs  17.15</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.73 vs   4.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.31 vs   8.77</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.72 vs  12.73</p>
<p> Sales		  144.61 vs 112.31</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat processing company is Farm</p>
<p>Food SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
